    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Linked list - digit-wise build</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/add-two-numbers/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 2</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Add Two Numbers</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">The digits are already stored ones-first, which is the order you add in by hand: walk both lists together, add digit + digit + carry, write sum % 10, and keep looping while either list or the carry is left. O(max(m, n)) time, O(1) extra space.</p>\n"
